OL,3,ATrump vows tougher economic measures on
OL,4,AIran and supporting countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fwill launch tougher economic measures
OL,8,Fagainst Iran, as well as any country
OL,9,Fand that helps or does business with
OL,10,Fthe country.
OL,12,FHe wrote in all capital letters on
OL,13,FTruth Social that he was launching "the
OL,14,Fmost crushing economic operation ever
OL,15,Ftaken against any country", but gave no
OL,16,Ffurther details and did not name any
OL,17,Fother nation apart from Iran.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
