OL,3,ATrump vows tougher economic measures on
OL,4,AIran and supporting countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a 60-day ceasefire with
OL,7,FIran expired on Monday, with no sign of
OL,8,Fa diplomatic or military off-ramp to
OL,9,Fthe conflict that the US and Israel
OL,10,Fbegan at the end of February.
OL,12,FTrump's latest move appears to extend
OL,13,Fthe US campaign of economic pressure,
OL,14,Flaunched in April to sanction foreign
OL,15,Fbanks or firms that do business with
OL,16,FTehran.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
